@startuml AutoRepair Pipeline Status

skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam rectangleFontSize 13
skinparam noteFontSize 11
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

title AutoRepair -- Pipeline Status (May 2026)

|Input|
    :Real C# repo\n(any GitHub project);

|Step 1\nInstrument + Trace|
    #palegreen :**WORKING**\nInstrument source\nwith trace hooks;
    note right: Roslyn rewrites every\nassignment, branch, cast\nand exception site
    #palegreen :**WORKING**\nRun existing tests\n(no new tests needed);
    #palegreen :**WORKING**\nCapture live trace\n(~1M events / medium repo);

|Step 2\nViolation Detection|
    #palegreen :**WORKING**\nParse trace\nDerive violations\n(file + line + evidence);
    note right: e.g. "DeclarationInfo.cs:30\nValidCast -> False"

|Step 3\nRepair Synthesis|
    #palegreen :**WORKING**\nLoad violations\nBuild CFG + call graph\nClassify each violation;
    note right: Uses Roslyn CFG\n+ interprocedural analysis
    if (Violation type?) then (Unhandled\nException)
        #palegreen :**WORKING**\nSynthesize try/catch\nWrite .diff patch file;
        note right: Verified on\nThrottleDebounce repo
    else (Invalid Cast\nor other type)
        #ffeeaa :**PARTIAL**\nClassified correctly\nbut no patch emitted yet;
        note right: Next task:\nadd ValidCast handler
    endif

|Output|
    :repair_plan.json\n+ .diff files (where available)\n+ report.md;

@enduml
